  "claim_short": "If Lambda is finite and contains the zero frequency, no positive non-atomic measure can be the unique total-variation-minimal extrapolation of its Fourier data on Lambda. A finite-dimensional real kernel produces a nonzero bounded density perturbation h; the distinct positive measures (1+h)mu and (1-h)mu have the same sampled Fourier coefficients and the same optimal norm.",
